    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Large Woven Rope Laundry Basket | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the OIAHOMY Large Woven Rope Laundry Basket, selected by KASODI for its generous 105-litre capacity, soft woven texture and calm neutral palette."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/bathroom">Bathroom</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Large Woven Rope Laundry Basket</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/bathroom/oiahomy-large-woven-rope-laundry-basket.png"
            alt="OIAHOMY large woven rope laundry basket styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · BATHROOM
          </p>

          <h1>
            Large Woven Rope Laundry Basket
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            OIAHOMY
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A generously sized woven laundry basket that combines everyday
            practicality with a softer, more decorative look. Its tall silhouette,
            neutral white and light-grey palette and tactile rope construction
            make it an easy fit for bathrooms, bedrooms and laundry spaces where
            storage remains visible.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Capacity</span>
              <strong>105 L</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Cotton rope</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>White · Light grey</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Height</span>
              <strong>Approx. 65 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Design</span>
              <strong>Tall · Foldable</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Ideal for</span>
              <strong>Laundry · Towels · Textiles</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/3SSv7C8"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Large laundry baskets are often highly practical but difficult to
            integrate into a considered interior. This one feels different.
          </p>

          <p>
            The woven rope construction gives it the softness of a textile
            accessory, while the tall rounded silhouette provides generous
            storage without looking bulky. We especially like the subtle
            contrast between white and light grey — neutral enough for an
            everyday bathroom, but more interesting than a plain utility basket.
          </p>

          <p>
            With a 105-litre capacity, it is substantial enough for family
            laundry, towels or bed linen, while the long handles make it easier
            to move when needed.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Keep its shape</h2>

        <p>
          Keep the basket in a dry, well-ventilated area and avoid prolonged
          contact with standing water. For everyday care, remove dust with a
          soft cloth or vacuum using a gentle attachment.
        </p>

        <p>
          If deeper cleaning is needed, follow the manufacturer's care
          instructions for the woven material and allow the basket to dry
          completely before filling it again. As the basket is supplied folded,
          reshaping it after unpacking and filling it with towels or textiles can
          help the woven sides return to their intended form.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Soft Cotton Towels</h3>
            <p>
              Warm white, ivory or oatmeal towels continue the soft tonal palette
              and reinforce the relaxed textile character of the basket.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Warm Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Cream ceramic bathroom accessories introduce a more structured
              surface beside the tactile woven rope and keep the palette calm.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Natural Wood</h3>
            <p>
              A bamboo shelf, wooden stool or other warm natural detail adds
              contrast and prevents a neutral bathroom from feeling too cool.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>KASODI EDIT</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/bathroom/ava-nord-ceramic-bathroom-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/ava-nord-ceramic-bathroom-set-cream.png"
                alt="Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>BATHROOM ACCESSORIES</span>
              <h3>Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set</h3>
              <p>Ava Nord</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/bathroom/harliangxy-glass-gold-cosmetic-organizer"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/harliangxy-glass-gold-cosmetic-organizer.png"
                alt="Glass and Gold Vanity Organizer"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>VANITY ORGANIZATION</span>
              <h3>Glass & Gold Vanity Organizer</h3>
              <p>HARLIANGXY</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/bathroom/songmics-bamboo-double-laundry-hamper"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/songmics-bamboo-double-laundry-hamper.png"
                alt="Bamboo Double Laundry Hamper"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>LAUNDRY & STORAGE</span>
              <h3>Bamboo Double Laundry Hamper</h3>
              <p>SONGMICS</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          OIAHOMY · LAUNDRY & STORAGE
        </p>

        <h2>
          Generous storage, with a softer side.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/3SSv7C8"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>